WEBVTT

00:04:58.377 --> 00:05:01.547
Sometimes I will just stand
in my neighborhood,

00:05:01.589 --> 00:05:03.382
looking at the ground like.

00:05:04.383 --> 00:05:07.720
(Laughter)

00:05:07.762 --> 00:05:11.932
And I'm baffled that no one
else seems to care.

00:05:13.768 --> 00:05:19.982
Now I am a forager and a vegan
for much the same reason.

00:05:19.982 --> 00:05:23.611
My love of this planet
and its inhabitants.

00:05:24.403 --> 00:05:26.572
But let me tell you,

00:05:26.614 --> 00:05:28.616
between those two identifiers,

00:05:28.616 --> 00:05:32.244
it's pretty hard to get people
to try my food.